{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0da58cbbccd0cdedcddeaa778e6a35c4f6172c56226bd49b1fbe7d97458ceb05"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"GraphQL Playground is a GraphQL IDE for better development workflows, supporting GraphQL Subscriptions, interactive docs, and collaboration."},{"claim_ids":["clm_209bb2b47a7a28a149d54378bc24c5df7acdc92ff73a89881952a1fb590cda02"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"From graphql-playground-react@1.7.0 a codeTheme property allows customizing editor colors via an EditorColours interface."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2d458782080ac05711005eb2d16071a3da437edb4c722158a397813ac7a780e9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributions are managed by EasyCLA; contributors must sign the GraphQL Specification Membership agreement, and the EasyCLA bot blocks merges without one."},{"claim_ids":["clm_36f042374a40c6010c9afdc4946bf5e42e0b9cf8de34242f02ccd2256bec98a9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The React component and all middlewares expose options including endpoint, subscriptionEndpoint, workspaceName, config, settings, schema (introspection override), and tabs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_54abca795f30238fb681dd0b20f5d883b0d0d5385f66deae53522525751c5c92"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The desktop app only partially supports graphql-config: multi-environment setups work but sending HTTP headers is not supported."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9ebcb6464a93f4e78dac1644d17cb39e6fc0eeb4c88a9d053dad58aa68e3fc57"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Playground uses GraphiQL components under the hood and adds multi-column docs, automatic schema reloading, subscriptions, query history, HTTP header configuration, and tabs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b48fa5399ce7ed549d0944cb7cf741e9e9117ab4b3f1681668c64dc7403da2fa"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"graphql-playground-html and its middleware dependents had an XSS Reflection vulnerability (CVE-2020-4038) with unsanitized user input, resolved in graphql-playground-html 1.6.22 and specific safe versions of each middleware."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cbec1da8466f99ca19c3ee75882494268ff16a84afb140541b1b5f0d66867243"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The React component additionally accepts createApolloLink, equivalent to GraphiQL's fetcher; it is unavailable in middlewares because their content must be serializable into an HTML template."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cf2e05f296d0b4155cea5ee668384b0a05a7a4754f05b2595e466a29b2fae661"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: local development of graphql-playground-react is done by running yarn and yarn start in packages/graphql-playground-react, then opening a localhost:3000 localDev page."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d08eb6835ac7539709254d7d53125c00de0256c412665b63a2e3dede59ac3b79"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The repository is a Yarn-workspaces monorepo whose package versions are not synchronized; release-page versions refer to the Electron app."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d7aa6ba873592ff1fea817eb6fc190deb17ed6ffb04a6c9beadf4c425495ed2a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Using the graphql-playground-react component requires React 16 plus the Open Sans and Source Code Pro fonts."},{"claim_ids":["clm_df3010ec7ac245a8fa69c394965f5ece7c13a3b9744bf6f470d64c890bedc37d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"User-facing settings include editor cursor shape, font family, size and theme, prettier options, request.credentials, schema polling enable/filter/interval, and tracing options."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e4a159098b8a0eaa49a309bc4b4677585ea54c77ce1b81486c0c5f1c5cf9e0e1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"When tabs are injected via the tabs prop, they are reset each time the page is reloaded."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f896a25cc41854b9e1d2f7d703f458e5af665adc114093b9e16cb213fb05309b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The packages folder contains an Electron app, an HTML page renderer, Express/Hapi/Koa/Lambda middlewares, and the React core, with each middleware using graphql-playground-html."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0da58cbbccd0cdedcddeaa778e6a35c4f6172c56226bd49b1fbe7d97458ceb05","clm_209bb2b47a7a28a149d54378bc24c5df7acdc92ff73a89881952a1fb590cda02","clm_2d458782080ac05711005eb2d16071a3da437edb4c722158a397813ac7a780e9","clm_36f042374a40c6010c9afdc4946bf5e42e0b9cf8de34242f02ccd2256bec98a9","clm_54abca795f30238fb681dd0b20f5d883b0d0d5385f66deae53522525751c5c92","clm_9ebcb6464a93f4e78dac1644d17cb39e6fc0eeb4c88a9d053dad58aa68e3fc57","clm_b48fa5399ce7ed549d0944cb7cf741e9e9117ab4b3f1681668c64dc7403da2fa","clm_cbec1da8466f99ca19c3ee75882494268ff16a84afb140541b1b5f0d66867243","clm_cf2e05f296d0b4155cea5ee668384b0a05a7a4754f05b2595e466a29b2fae661","clm_d08eb6835ac7539709254d7d53125c00de0256c412665b63a2e3dede59ac3b79","clm_d7aa6ba873592ff1fea817eb6fc190deb17ed6ffb04a6c9beadf4c425495ed2a","clm_df3010ec7ac245a8fa69c394965f5ece7c13a3b9744bf6f470d64c890bedc37d","clm_e4a159098b8a0eaa49a309bc4b4677585ea54c77ce1b81486c0c5f1c5cf9e0e1","clm_f896a25cc41854b9e1d2f7d703f458e5af665adc114093b9e16cb213fb05309b"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:55:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_4a482c056b734de7808c0bc173f4d932","id":"pg_12e1194b42d05881a28e2a7f208f5a48","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/graphql-graphql-playground-readme-md-05861783f778-2a7f208f5a48.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_51b61ebd06dd547d83571663cb0e8c05"],"title":"graphql/graphql-playground/README.md @ 05861783f778","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:55:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4a482c056b734de7808c0bc173f4d932"}
